---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Erdem Analytics — Built in Nairobi for East Africa.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">About Erdem</span>
      <h1>Built in Nairobi.<br/><span class="cyan">Built for East Africa.</span></h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:64px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <span class="label">The Company</span>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:16px;">Data analytics and intelligence —<br/><span class="cyan">on a retainer, not on request.</span></h2>
        <div style="width:40px;height:2px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:1px;margin:16px 0 24px;"></div>
        <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Erdem is a data analytics and business intelligence company based in Kenya, built to serve organizations across East Africa that are data-rich but insight-poor.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Most SMEs, financial institutions, and NGOs generate significant operational data every day — from loan repayments and sales figures to inventory movements and project outcomes — but lack the tools, skills, or bandwidth to turn that data into decisions.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Erdem bridges that gap. We take raw, often scattered data and transform it into clear, actionable intelligence — delivered through dashboards, automated reports, predictive models, and AI-driven workflows that clients can actually use.</p>
        <p>We operate as a <strong style="color:var(--white);">platform provider, not a one-off consultancy</strong>. We embed in your operations on a retainer basis, becoming a recurring fixture in how you monitor performance, catch problems early, and plan ahead.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-up">
        <div style="border-radius:var(--r-lg);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--b-cyan);">
          <img src="/images/ivan.jpg" alt="Ivan Wekesa — Founder" style="width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;"/>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:20px 0 0;">
          <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--white);">Ivan Wekesa</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.87rem;color:var(--cyan);margin:4px 0 12px;">Founder & Lead Analyst</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:14px;">Data analytics professional based in Nairobi with deep expertise in Power BI, Python, and BI architecture. BSc Mathematics & Computer Science, JKUAT. AWS ML & Google Cybersecurity certified.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;"><span class="tag">Power BI</span><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">SQL</span><span class="tag">Qlik Sense</span><span class="tag">ML/TensorFlow</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section s-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label" style="text-align:center;display:block;">Our Approach</span>
      <h2 style="text-align:center;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto 48px;">Three principles that define how we work.</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;">
        <div class="fade-up" style="padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
          <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:14px;">01</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:12px;">Platform, not project</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.87rem;">We build data infrastructure that grows with your organization — not dashboards that collect dust after delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up" style="padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
          <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:14px;">02</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:12px;">Actionable, not academic</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.87rem;">Our models and dashboards are built to drive decisions. If a client can't act on what we build, we haven't done our job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up" style="padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
          <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:14px;">03</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:12px;">Regional depth</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.87rem;">We understand SASRA, CBK, M-Pesa, and East African market realities. That context is our competitive advantage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section s-mid" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:14px;">Ready to work with us?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:420px;margin:0 auto 32px;">Get in touch and we'll talk through what an Erdem engagement looks like for your organization.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cyan">Talk to Us →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>@media(max-width:900px){[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 360px"],[style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}}</style>
